 the base of it being made out of Darkslate, the top being Refined <b><a href=\"/wiki/Sapphire\" title=\"Sapphire\">Sapphire</a></b>, and two ropes wrap around the base with a sapphire stone at the bottom of the base.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903135853\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 87/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019500/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.203      1 Template:Tool\n100.00%   30.203      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3942-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903135853 and revision id 18448. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Infobox_templates","Tools","Chisels"],"links":[{"title":"Ice Golem Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Sapphire","exists":true}],"images":["Celestialchisel.png","Missing_Image.png","167486099_9938675423_1742938290426.png"]}
